/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "ハーレルヤ！明日は！ハレルヤ！ハレルヤ！ハーレールーヤー！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "我は勝利を誓う刃金(はがね)　我は禍風(まがつかぜ)に挑む翼\n無窮(むきゅう)の空を超え　霊子(アエテュル)の海を渡り　翔けよ、刃金(はがね)の翼！\n\n舞い降りよ――アンブロシウス！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "遥か未来、銀河を統べる「星盟」が崩壊の危機に瀕していた。多元宇宙の狭間から現れた「虚無の使者」が、星々を飲み込み、存在そのものを消滅させていく。主人公は、名もなき辺境の星で生まれた若者・アレン。偶然発見した古代の遺物「星核」が彼の内に眠る力を覚醒させ、銀河の運命を担う「選ばれし者」として立ち上がる。\nアレンは、機械種族の技師、神秘を操る巫女、反逆の海賊王ら個性的な仲間と共に、虚無の使者の真の目的を探る旅に出る。旅の先々で、星盟の腐敗、種族間の確執、そして自らの過去に隠された秘密が明らかに。やがて、虚無の使者が多元宇宙の均衡を保つための「必要悪」である可能性が浮上し、アレンは究極の選択を迫られる――全てを救うため、自らの存在を犠牲にするのか、それとも新たな秩序を築くため戦い続けるのか。\n\n銀河を舞台に繰り広げられる絆と裏切り、希望と絶望の叙事詩。果たして、アレンは運命を切り開けるのか。\nさあ、物語が始まる。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "帰りなボウズ\nここぁケツの青いガキが来る所じゃねぇぜ？", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/49", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "穢し(けがし)給う(たまう)、呪い給う、祟り(たたり)給う。\n幽世(かくりよ)の闇、岩戸(いわと)の奥に潜む影の神霊(しんれい)に聞こし召す(きこしめす)。\n朽(く)ちよ、爛(ただ)れよ、腐り落ちよ。\nされば、かの者が歩む道を、霧深き幽谷(ゆうこく)に迷わせ給え。\n清浄(せいじょう)なる流れを、穢れをもて濁らせ給え。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a046334862875bc001a1ad29f27a2a, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25694e36670c0eeda397b6ca7f94d0d4 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d616754f99caaa97d9c59308b7bc989 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "君が悲しんでいるときオレが君の側で、なぐさめてあげる。\n辛いときは君の味方になってあげる。\nもし！世界中の！みなが！君のことを！否定したとし〜……たら……その時は君が悪くないか？\n\n流石に80億人から『ソレっておかしいよ！』って言われてるのに、自分が正しい！って言ってるのはヤバいって！\n一緒にゴメンナサイしてあげるから、一度冷静になって話し合おうか。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HiiragiCorin/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2245a9006c936e6e70ed6d2c64b27cc1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088448%2FjjJktMN9.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2245a9006c936e6e70ed6d2c64b27cc1, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1990012806218088